ore it?","In the closed bag, somewhere dry, away from sunlight and the fridge. Best within 4 weeks of opening."]]}'::jsonb, '{"notes":["توت","زهور","مشمش","زهر البرتقال"],"notesEn":["Berries","Floral","Apricot","Orange blossom"],"family":"fruity","scales":{"body":3,"acidity":3}}'::jsonb)
